                "quoted_status_profile_username": "WhiteHouse",
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "After more than three long years, Marc Fogel\u2019s reprehensible confinement by Russia has come to an end. His wrongful detention in a Russian prison has been a strain on his health, his family, and his loved ones. \n\nLast month, I joined my Pennsylvania colleagues in a letter to Secretary of State Marco Rubio urging the State Department to prioritize Marc\u2019s release. \n\nI am grateful to President Trump and his Administration for fulfilling their promise, and today, Pennsylvania is thrilled to welcome Marc Fogel home.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1739373470,
                "view_count": 4512
