                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This morning, we visited PA08\u2019s local VA Medical Center in Wilkes-Barre for a tour of their facilities. We discussed how we can work together for our veterans, including through the Simplifying Forms for Veterans Claims Act, which I introduced last week to support our nation\u2019s past and present soldiers and their families. Thank you, VA Wilkes-Barre for showing us around!",
