                "text": "On National Nurses Day, we recognize our nurses and the critical care and compassion they offer patients at every stage of life, from the ER to care facilities to home health. Our nurses make a real and lasting difference in the lives of countless families in NEPA \u2013 thank you! https://t.co/V9ubyhrscQ",
